{"post_stream": {"posts": [{"id": 508206, "name": "Mitch Franklin", "username": "mitchfranklin", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/m/ffd117/{size}.png", "created_at": "2026-06-03T12:36:35.452Z", "cooked": "<p>I observed that I’m getting this module either upon initial installation of 44 (from bare metal) or upon the first update, even though I have no nVidia anything in my machine.</p>", "post_number": 1, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 16, "updated_at": "2026-06-03T12:36:35.452Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 109, "reads": 42, "readers_count": 41, "score": 553.4, "yours": false, "topic_id": 193036, "topic_slug": "nvidia-gpu-firmware-is-being-installed-unnessarily", "display_username": "Mitch Franklin", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 34084, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 0, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/nvidia-gpu-firmware-is-being-installed-unnessarily/193036/1", "event": null, "calendar_details": [], "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 508207, "name": "MatH", "username": "theprogram", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/theprogram/{size}/53169_2.png", "created_at": "2026-06-03T12:38:56.837Z", "cooked": "<p>It will be included in Workstation just in case.</p>\n<p>You can remove it.</p>\n<p>And it is installed in Everything custom install, I have it on my machine.</p>", "post_number": 2, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 16, "updated_at": "2026-06-03T12:48:39.228Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 0, "reads": 42, "readers_count": 41, "score": 13.4, "yours": false, "topic_id": 193036, "topic_slug": "nvidia-gpu-firmware-is-being-installed-unnessarily", "display_username": "MatH", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": "mindshare", "flair_url": "book-atlas", "flair_bg_color": "51a2daff", "flair_color": "", "flair_group_id": 63, "badges_granted": [], "version": 2, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "Welcome Wagon", "title_is_group": false, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 16174, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 4, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/nvidia-gpu-firmware-is-being-installed-unnessarily/193036/2", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 508210, "name": "P G", "username": "pg-tips", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/p/aad0ee/{size}.png", "created_at": "2026-06-03T12:41:22.057Z", "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group quote-modified\" data-username=\"theprogram\" data-display-name=\"MatH\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"193036\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/theprogram/48/53169_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MatH:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>you can use a more custom install from the Everything ISO installer (though it may even be included there, I would have to test)</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I think the whole <code>linux-firmware</code> package would get installed, with all its subpackages including <code>nvidia-gpu-firmware</code>.</p>\n<p>Realistically you probably have to be resigned to uninstalling it after install.</p>", "post_number": 3, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 16, "updated_at": "2026-06-03T12:41:22.057Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 2, "quote_count": 1, "incoming_link_count": 4, "reads": 42, "readers_count": 41, "score": 33.4, "yours": false, "topic_id": 193036, "topic_slug": "nvidia-gpu-firmware-is-being-installed-unnessarily", "display_username": "P G", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 16174, "username": "theprogram", "name": "MatH", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/theprogram/{size}/53169_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 25377, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 3, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/nvidia-gpu-firmware-is-being-installed-unnessarily/193036/3", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 508211, "name": "MatH", "username": "theprogram", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/theprogram/{size}/53169_2.png", "created_at": "2026-06-03T12:42:29.799Z", "cooked": "<p>Great point, it will uninstall</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-plaintext\">Package                                           Arch         Version                                           Repository                      Size\nRemoving:\n linux-firmware                                   noarch       0:20260519-1.fc44                                 updates                     49.9 MiB\nRemoving unused dependencies:\n amd-gpu-firmware                                 noarch       0:20260519-1.fc44                                 updates                     26.2 MiB\n atheros-firmware                                 noarch       0:20260519-1.fc44                                 updates                     45.2 MiB\n brcmfmac-firmware                                noarch       0:20260519-1.fc44                                 updates                      9.5 MiB\n cirrus-audio-firmware                            noarch       0:20260519-1.fc44                                 updates                      2.7 MiB\n intel-audio-firmware                             noarch       0:20260519-1.fc44                                 updates                      3.3 MiB\n intel-gpu-firmware                               noarch       0:20260519-1.fc44                                 updates                      8.8 MiB\n mt7xxx-firmware                                  noarch       0:20260519-1.fc44                                 updates                     22.9 MiB\n nvidia-gpu-firmware                              noarch       0:20260519-1.fc44                                 updates                    101.0 MiB\n nxpwireless-firmware                             noarch       0:20260519-1.fc44                                 updates                    905.2 KiB\n qcom-wwan-firmware                               noarch       0:20260519-1.fc44                                 updates                    749.7 KiB\n realtek-firmware                                 noarch       0:20260519-1.fc44                                 updates                      6.1 MiB\n tiwilink-firmware                                noarch       0:20260519-1.fc44                                 updates                      4.6 MiB\n</code></pre>", "post_number": 4, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 16, "updated_at": "2026-06-03T12:42:29.799Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 3, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 3, "reads": 40, "readers_count": 39, "score": 23.0, "yours": false, "topic_id": 193036, "topic_slug": "nvidia-gpu-firmware-is-being-installed-unnessarily", "display_username": "MatH", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": "mindshare", "flair_url": "book-atlas", "flair_bg_color": "51a2daff", "flair_color": "", "flair_group_id": 63, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "Welcome Wagon", "title_is_group": false, "reply_to_user": {"id": 25377, "username": "pg-tips", "name": "P G", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/p/aad0ee/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 16174, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 4, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/nvidia-gpu-firmware-is-being-installed-unnessarily/193036/4", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 508212, "name": "Mitch Franklin", "username": "mitchfranklin", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/m/ffd117/{size}.png", "created_at": "2026-06-03T12:42:46.608Z", "cooked": "<p>Thanks guys. What’s the proper way to uninstall it? (I could guess but I don’t want to do something that leaves me with an even-worse half installation.)</p>", "post_number": 5, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 16, "updated_at": "2026-06-03T12:42:46.608Z", "reply_count": 2, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 1, "reads": 40, "readers_count": 39, "score": 23.0, "yours": false, "topic_id": 193036, "topic_slug": "nvidia-gpu-firmware-is-being-installed-unnessarily", "display_username": "Mitch Franklin", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 34084, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 0, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/nvidia-gpu-firmware-is-being-installed-unnessarily/193036/5", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 508213, "name": "P G", "username": "pg-tips", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/p/aad0ee/{size}.png", "created_at": "2026-06-03T12:44:15.337Z", "cooked": "<p><code>sudo dnf remove nvidia-gpu-firmware</code> should do the job.</p>", "post_number": 6, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 16, "updated_at": "2026-06-03T12:44:15.337Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 5, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 4, "reads": 39, "readers_count": 38, "score": 42.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 193036, "topic_slug": "nvidia-gpu-firmware-is-being-installed-unnessarily", "display_username": "P G", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 34084, "username": "mitchfranklin", "name": "Mitch Franklin", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/m/ffd117/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 25377, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 3, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/nvidia-gpu-firmware-is-being-installed-unnessarily/193036/6", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": true, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 508214, "name": "MatH", "username": "theprogram", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/theprogram/{size}/53169_2.png", "created_at": "2026-06-03T12:45:13.718Z", "cooked": "<p>You don’t need to uninstall it.</p>\n<p>Note the packages it will uninstall as I posted above.  if you remove linux-firmware, you will need to manually reinstall all the dependent packages that you need individually.</p>\n<p>I would advise to not worry about it, and leave it there.</p>", "post_number": 7, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 16, "updated_at": "2026-06-03T12:45:13.718Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 5, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 10, "reads": 39, "readers_count": 38, "score": 62.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 193036, "topic_slug": "nvidia-gpu-firmware-is-being-installed-unnessarily", "display_username": "MatH", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": "mindshare", "flair_url": "book-atlas", "flair_bg_color": "51a2daff", "flair_color": "", "flair_group_id": 63, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "Welcome Wagon", "title_is_group": false, "reply_to_user": {"id": 34084, "username": "mitchfranklin", "name": "Mitch Franklin", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/m/ffd117/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 16174, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 4, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/nvidia-gpu-firmware-is-being-installed-unnessarily/193036/7", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 508215, "name": "P G", "username": "pg-tips", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/p/aad0ee/{size}.png", "created_at": "2026-06-03T12:45:41.240Z", "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"theprogram\" data-display-name=\"MatH\" data-post=\"7\" data-topic=\"193036\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/theprogram/48/53169_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MatH:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>if you remove linux-firmware, you will need to manually reinstall all the dependent packages that you need individually</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>You can just remove the child package <code>nvidia-gpu-firmware</code> without removing all its siblings.</p>", "post_number": 8, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 16, "updated_at": "2026-06-03T12:45:41.240Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 7, "quote_count": 1, "incoming_link_count": 0, "reads": 40, "readers_count": 39, "score": 13.0, "yours": false, "topic_id": 193036, "topic_slug": "nvidia-gpu-firmware-is-being-installed-unnessarily", "display_username": "P G", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 16174, "username": "theprogram", "name": "MatH", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/theprogram/{size}/53169_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 25377, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 3, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/nvidia-gpu-firmware-is-being-installed-unnessarily/193036/8", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 508216, "name": "MatH", "username": "theprogram", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/theprogram/{size}/53169_2.png", "created_at": "2026-06-03T12:46:18.828Z", "cooked": "<p>OOPS!  I ran the wrong command!</p>", "post_number": 9, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 16, "updated_at": "2026-06-03